---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Shutter Scotland | See Edinburgh Differently">
	<main>
		<!-- ORIGINAL HERO MANIFESTO SECTION -->
		<section style="display: flex; flex-direction: row; flex-wrap: wrap; width: 100%; border-bottom: 3px solid #0A0A0A; overflow: hidden; background-color: #FAFAFA;">
			
			<div style="flex: 0 0 auto; width: 41.66%; min-width: 320px; padding: 48px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; border-right: 3px solid #0A0A0A; box-sizing: border-box; background-color: #FAFAFA;">
				
				<div style="margin-bottom: 40px;">
					<h2 style="font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; background-color: #0A0A0A; color: #FAFAFA; padding: 2px 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; display: inline-block; margin: 0;">
						EDINBURGH GUIDED PHOTO TOUR // MANIFESTO_01
					</h2>
					<h1 style="font-family: 'Arial Black', 'Impact', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 4vw, 4.5rem); text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 0.9; letter-spacing: -0.05em; color: #0A0A0A; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 0;">
						SEE EDINBURGH <br><span style="color: #FF4500;">DIFFERENTLY.</span>
					</h1>
				</div>
				
				<div style="margin-bottom: 40px;">
					<p style="font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; color: #3F3F46; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 440px; border-left: 3px solid #FF4500; padding-left: 16px; margin: 0 0 16px 0;">
						Most city tours are just history lectures in disguise. Most photography sites just want to sell you a print. Shutter Scotland is the bridge between the two. 
					</p>
					<p style="font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; color: #0A0A0A; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 440px; margin: 0;">
						We hit Edinburgh’s iconic historic landmarks, but we view them through a completely different lens. Whether you are looking for an Edinburgh guided photo tour to master your frame, or a unique street photography walk through the Old Town, we’ll show you how to look past the postcard clichés, chase the deep shadows, and capture the city’s actual, unpolished pulse.
					</p>
				</div>
				
				<div style="padding-bottom: 12px;">
					<a href="/portfolio" class="brutalist-cta-btn" style="display: inline-block; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none; border: 3px solid #0A0A0A; background-color: #FF4500; color: #FAFAFA; padding: 14px 28px; letter-spacing: 0.05em; box-shadow: 4px 4px 0px 0px #0A0A0A;">
						[LOCK IN A ROUTE]
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>
			
			<div style="flex: 1 1 0%; min-width: 320px; min-height: 550px; background-color: #0A0A0A; position: relative; box-sizing: border-box;">
				<img 
					src="/images/royal-mile-street-image.jpg" 
					alt="Black and white street photography of Edinburgh Royal Mile through a stone archway" 
					style="position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; filter: contrast(1.15);"
				/>
				<div style="position: absolute; bottom: 16px; right: 16px; background-color: #0A0A0A; border: 1px solid #FAFAFA; color: #FAFAFA; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 4px 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; opacity: 0.8; z-index: 20;">
					LOC_EDINBURGH_ROYAL_MILE
				</div>
			</div>

		</section>

		<!-- ORIGINAL 01 / 02 / 03 GRID SECTION -->
		<section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 font-mono-clean text-sm border-b border-punk-black bg-punk-white">
			<div class="p-6 md:p-8 border-b md:border-b-0 md:border-r border-punk-black space-y-3">
				<h3 class="font-sans-heavy text-lg uppercase tracking-tight text-punk-black">01 // VISUAL ISOLATION</h3>
				<p class="text-punk-grey">Bypass the visual chaos of the busy streets. Learn how to frame a clear subject, cut out the noise, and decide exactly what deserves attention in your shot.</p>
			</div>
			
			<div class="p-6 md:p-8 border-b md:border-b-0 md:border-r border-punk-black space-y-3">
				<h3 class="font-sans-heavy text-lg uppercase tracking-tight text-punk-black">02 // CHASE THE LIGHT</h3>
				<p class="text-punk-grey">Read the urban geometry of Edinburgh's historic closes. Use deep architectural shadows as negative space to create a stage, waiting for the perfect light to frame your subject.</p>
			</div>
			
			<div class="p-6 md:p-8 space-y-3">
				<h3 class="font-sans-heavy text-lg uppercase tracking-tight text-punk-black">03 // OWN THE ARTWORK</h3>
				<p class="text-punk-grey">Stop filling your phone storage with digital noise. Finish the walk with custom-framed, gallery-grade captures that look distinctively yours.</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- NEW TOUR DETAILS & TEASER GRID INSERTED HERE -->
		<section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 font-sans text-punk-black bg-punk-white">
			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
				
				<!-- TOUR 1: Edinburgh Flagship -->
				<div class="border-heavy border-punk-black p-8 flex flex-col justify-between bg-punk-white">
					<div>
						<span class="font-mono-clean text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-punk-accent block mb-2">// FLAGSHIP TOUR</span>
						<h2 class="text-3xl font-sans-heavy uppercase tracking-tight mb-4">FRAMING THE OLD TOWN</h2>
						<p class="font-mono-clean text-xs text-punk-grey leading-relaxed mb-6">
							Explore the dramatic vertical geometry, dark medieval closes, and high-contrast light pockets of Edinburgh's historic core. Master perspective and composition without corporate gear gatekeeping.
						</p>
					</div>
					<a href="/tours/edinburgh" class="inline-block text-center bg-punk-black text-punk-white font-mono-clean text-xs uppercase font-bold py-3 px-6 hover:bg-punk-accent transition-colors">
						VIEW WORKSHOP DETAILS
					</a>
				</div>

				<!-- TOUR 2: Glasgow Coming Soon -->
				<div class="border-heavy border-punk-black p-8 flex flex-col justify-between bg-punk-black text-punk-white">
					<div>
						<span class="font-mono-clean text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-punk-accent block mb-2">// COMING SOON</span>
						<h2 class="text-3xl font-sans-heavy uppercase tracking-tight mb-4 text-punk-white">GLASGOW SUB-CULTURE</h2>
						<p class="font-mono-clean text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed mb-6">
							Seeking visual inspiration from the post-punk and goth genres. Exploring the brutalist corners, concrete raw architecture, and hidden underground scenes of Glasgow.
						</p>
					</div>
					<div class="inline-block text-center border border-zinc-700 text-zinc-500 font-mono-clean text-xs uppercase py-3 px-6 cursor-not-allowed">
						EDITS IN PROGRESS
					</div>
				</div>
				
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- ORIGINAL BOTTOM SUMMARY GALLERY BUILDER SECTION -->
		<section style="display: flex; flex-direction: row; flex-wrap: wrap; width: 100%; border-bottom: 3px solid #0A0A0A; background-color: #FAFAFA; overflow: hidden;">
			
			<div style="flex: 1 1 50%; min-width: 320px; padding: 48px; background-color: #0A0A0A; color: #FAFAFA; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; box-sizing: border-box;">
				<div>
					<span style="font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; color: #FF4500; tracking: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;">MISSION_02 // THE TOUR</span>
					<h2 style="font-family: 'Arial Black', 'Impact', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 3.5rem); text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 0.95; letter-spacing: -0.04em; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 24px;">
						READY TO BUILD <br>YOUR GALLERY?
					</h2>
					<p style="font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; color: #A1A1AA; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 480px; margin: 0 0 32px 0;">
						We’ve engineered this route to maximize your creative output without the exhaustion. No wasted steps, no fluff—just pure focus on light, framing, and perspective across Edinburgh’s most iconic structural backdrops.
					</p>
				</div>
				
				<div>
					<a href="/contact" class="brutalist-action-btn" style="display: inline-block; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none; border: 3px solid #FAFAFA; background-color: #FAFAFA; color: #0A0A0A; padding: 16px 32px; letter-spacing: 0.05em; transition: all 0.2s ease-in-out;">
						[ CLAIM A SPOT ON THE WALK ]
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div style="flex: 1 1 50%; min-width: 320px; padding: 48px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; box-sizing: border-box; background-color: #FAFAFA;">
				
				<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 32px; width: 100%;">
					
					<div style="border-left: 3px solid #0A0A0A; padding-left: 16px;">
						<h4 style="font-family: 'Arial Black', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #0A0A0A;">DURATION</h4>
						<p style="font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 13px; color: #3F3F46; margin: 0; line-height: 1.4;">Under 2 hours. Tightly paced to keep your energy high and your eye sharp.</p>
					</div>

					<div style="border-left: 3px solid #0A0A0A; padding-left: 16px;">
						<h4 style="font-family: 'Arial Black', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #0A0A0A;">PACE</h4>
						<p style="font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 13px; color: #3F3F46; margin: 0; line-height: 1.4;">Fully walkable, highly accessible loop mapped through the historic Old Town.</p>
					</div>

					<div style="border-left: 3px solid #0A0A0A; padding-left: 16px;">
						<h4 style="font-family: 'Arial Black', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #0A0A0A;">COMPATIBILITY</h4>
						<p style="font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 13px; color: #3F3F46; margin: 0; line-height: 1.4;">100% hardware agnostic. Perfect for flagship DSLRs, mirrorless kits, or smartphones.</p>
					</div>

					<div style="border-left: 3px solid #0A0A0A; padding-left: 16px;">
						<h4 style="font-family: 'Arial Black', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #0A0A0A;">THE PAYOFF</h4>
						<p style="font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 13px; color: #3F3F46; margin: 0; line-height: 1.4;">Walk away with immediate, real-world framing techniques you can deploy anywhere on earth.</p>
					</div>

				</div>

			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</MainLayout>

<style>
	.brutalist-cta-btn {
		transition: all 0.2s ease-in-out !important;
	}

	.brutalist-cta-btn:hover {
		background-color: #0A0A0A !important;
		color: #FF4500 !important;
		border-color: #FF4500 !important;
		box-shadow: 0px 0px 0px 0px #0A0A0A !important;
		transform: translate(4px, 4px) !important;
	}
	
	.brutalist-cta-btn:active {
		transform: scale(0.98) !important;
	}
</style>